OL,3,GNEWSASlow Horses writer says Jersey
OL,4,Ashaped his career
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe lead writer behind hit television
OL,7,Fdrama Slow Horses has credited Jersey
OL,8,Fwith helping launch his career.
OL,10,FThree-time Emmy Award winner Will
OL,11,FSmith, creator of the Apple TV+ spy
OL,12,Fdrama which follows a team of failed or
OL,13,Fdisgraced MI5 agents led by Jackson
OL,14,FLamb - played by Sir Gary Oldman, grew
OL,15,Fup on the island and attended Victoria
OL,16,FCollege.
OL,18,FSmith said Jersey's creative community
OL,19,Fprovided a "fertile, supportive
OL,20,Fenvironment" which helped lay the
OL,21,Ffoundations for his success.
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
