OL,3,GNEWSASlow Horses writer says Jersey
OL,4,Ashaped his career
OL,5,
OL,6,FSlow Horses is up for nine awards at
OL,7,Fthe upcoming Primetime Emmys in Los
OL,8,FAngeles on 14 September, with Smith
OL,9,Fnominated in the Outstanding Writing
OL,10,FFor A Drama Series category.
